    <!-- Battery guide -->
    <string name="battery_intro">Some phones stop apps in the background to save battery, which can delay or block reminders. Allowing DozDefteri to run without battery restrictions keeps reminders on time.</string>
    <string name="battery_steps_generic">1. Open Settings > Apps > DozDefteri > Battery.\n2. Choose \"Unrestricted\" or \"Don\'t optimize\".\n3. Make sure notifications are allowed for DozDefteri.</string>
    <string name="battery_steps_xiaomi">1. Settings > Apps > Manage apps > DozDefteri.\n2. Turn on \"Autostart\".\n3. Battery saver > \"No restrictions\".\n4. In recent apps, long press DozDefteri and tap the lock icon.</string>
    <string name="battery_steps_samsung">1. Settings > Battery > Background usage limits.\n2. Make sure DozDefteri is not in \"Sleeping apps\" or \"Deep sleeping apps\".\n3. Settings > Apps > DozDefteri > Battery > \"Unrestricted\".</string>
    <string name="battery_steps_huawei">1. Settings > Battery > App launch.\n2. Find DozDefteri, turn off \"Manage automatically\".\n3. Turn on \"Auto-launch\", \"Secondary launch\" and \"Run in background\".</string>
    <string name="battery_steps_oppo">1. Settings > Battery > More settings > Optimize battery use: choose \"Don\'t optimize\" for DozDefteri.\n2. Settings > Apps > DozDefteri > Battery usage: allow background activity and auto launch.</string>

